{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Abbess Garden is a third-person gardening game set in an abandoned abbey of Port-Royal-des-Champs, in the heart of France.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's 1643, and you play as Agn\u00e8s, a young peasant at the centre of a spy intrigue.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/4bd38fda61f8353e8c378f44a430ad34.avif?t=1753349921\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/142108cab2e1df0b1acd129ad8976c1d.poster.avif?t=1753349921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/142108cab2e1df0b1acd129ad8976c1d.webm?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/142108cab2e1df0b1acd129ad8976c1d.mp4?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nurture the Abbess' garden using gardening techniques based on real horticulture.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant seeds and take care of the plants to see them grow into full bloom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/d7badd75d0f22790aa55e97cfed77e52.avif?t=1753349921\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/ad0323af93a88e713fdb95f96df9fce9.poster.avif?t=1753349921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/ad0323af93a88e713fdb95f96df9fce9.webm?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/ad0323af93a88e713fdb95f96df9fce9.mp4?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and identify all plants at all their stages of evolution as you explore the garden.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are hidden objects in the garden. Finding them will fulfil your collections, trigger new quests and dialogues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/e2f86d5393215bc7a20f794fb9405ed6.avif?t=1753349921\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/43ea78aa1d6c69f34054ea868e4ba7ff.poster.avif?t=1753349921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/43ea78aa1d6c69f34054ea868e4ba7ff.webm?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/43ea78aa1d6c69f34054ea868e4ba7ff.mp4?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The abbey harbours many secrets and wonders of years long gone. It is now used by the mysterious Solitaires taking their lodging in the area. But one place remains forbidden to them.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Abbess gave to you, Agn\u00e8s, the keys to her personal and majestic garden. You have been tasked to restore the holy place. Yet more than just ragworts and critters who hide in the weeds\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a book written by a deceased spy, help the local community understand it before the British and French royals do and find love!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/2c92a8df648af43ef07271a3c8da6b14.avif?t=1753349921\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add The Abbess Garden to your wishlist, follow us, and join our newsletter so you don't miss any news!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83c\udfb2\ud83c\udfb2\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0<strong>Demo content disclaimer\ud83c\udfb2</strong>\ud83c\udfb2\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br>The demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The first 3 chapters of the game (out of 25 in the full game): March to May 1643.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;water need&quot; system (one of the 3 vegetal systems, the other two are the soil system- sandy, acidic, rich...- and the proximity system - which plants like to be alone, close to other plants, close to a specific one...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 plants (out of 25)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is not limited in time: you can play as slowly as you like and replay the first 3 chapters at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is only available in English, for Windows, and can be played only with a mouse and keyboard. Steam Deck and controller support will only be available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873090?t=1753349921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873090?t=1753349921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/9dd46be169878f9c944f9041632e5ccd6978a953/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753349921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/9dd46be169878f9c944f9041632e5ccd6978a953/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753349921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Abbess Garden is a third-person gardening game set in an abandoned abbey of Port-Royal-des-Champs, in the heart of France.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's 1643, and you play as Agn\u00e8s, a young peasant at the centre of a spy intrigue.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/4bd38fda61f8353e8c378f44a430ad34.avif?t=1753349921\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/142108cab2e1df0b1acd129ad8976c1d.poster.avif?t=1753349921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/142108cab2e1df0b1acd129ad8976c1d.webm?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/142108cab2e1df0b1acd129ad8976c1d.mp4?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nurture the Abbess' garden using gardening techniques based on real horticulture.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant seeds and take care of the plants to see them grow into full bloom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/d7badd75d0f22790aa55e97cfed77e52.avif?t=1753349921\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/ad0323af93a88e713fdb95f96df9fce9.poster.avif?t=1753349921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/ad0323af93a88e713fdb95f96df9fce9.webm?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/ad0323af93a88e713fdb95f96df9fce9.mp4?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and identify all plants at all their stages of evolution as you explore the garden.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are hidden objects in the garden. Finding them will fulfil your collections, trigger new quests and dialogues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/e2f86d5393215bc7a20f794fb9405ed6.avif?t=1753349921\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/43ea78aa1d6c69f34054ea868e4ba7ff.poster.avif?t=1753349921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/43ea78aa1d6c69f34054ea868e4ba7ff.webm?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/43ea78aa1d6c69f34054ea868e4ba7ff.mp4?t=1753349921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The abbey harbours many secrets and wonders of years long gone. It is now used by the mysterious Solitaires taking their lodging in the area. But one place remains forbidden to them.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Abbess gave to you, Agn\u00e8s, the keys to her personal and majestic garden. You have been tasked to restore the holy place. Yet more than just ragworts and critters who hide in the weeds\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a book written by a deceased spy, help the local community understand it before the British and French royals do and find love!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/extras/2c92a8df648af43ef07271a3c8da6b14.avif?t=1753349921\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add The Abbess Garden to your wishlist, follow us, and join our newsletter so you don't miss any news!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83c\udfb2\ud83c\udfb2\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0<strong>Demo content disclaimer\ud83c\udfb2</strong>\ud83c\udfb2\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br>The demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The first 3 chapters of the game (out of 25 in the full game): March to May 1643.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;water need&quot; system (one of the 3 vegetal systems, the other two are the soil system- sandy, acidic, rich...- and the proximity system - which plants like to be alone, close to other plants, close to a specific one...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 plants (out of 25)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is not limited in time: you can play as slowly as you like and replay the first 3 chapters at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is only available in English, for Windows, and can be played only with a mouse and keyboard. Steam Deck and controller support will only be available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["MD Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3411970","name":"The Abbess Garden"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/6f9d3da1c1db373b4d134dfd83cc6b7ccbd2aab4/header.jpg?t=1753349921","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257167384,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167384/movie480.mp4?t=1753090442","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167384/movie_max.mp4?t=1753090442"},"name":"Demo Gameplay Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167384/b120dcb0b87438d80f8b115aa0071e7b4397fb55/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753090442","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167384/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753090442","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167384/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753090442"}}],"name":"The Abbess Garden Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB display memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["MD Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q3 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873090/9120a39a983d1df7444b6b11f15c220d63f18